 "file": "story/spt/f11_150_950_00_t025.spt",
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 1039,
   "src": "a79c3e558321",
   "t": "{{principal|cap}}!?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1044,
   "src": "f71322c5c57d",
   "t": "{{principal|cap}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1050,
   "src": "2be3e0b99f44",
   "t": "Its movement organs are armored in\nthick {{medalium}},"
  },
  {
   "i": 1053,
   "src": "32fb21886f77",
   "t": "so attacks barely get through."
  },
  {
   "i": 1061,
   "src": "1322416e2f03",
   "t": "We can't fight at all unless we fight near\nits head."
  },
  {
   "i": 1068,
   "src": "1f52894300b9",
   "t": "{{ginrei}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1077,
   "src": "661e02583f4d",
   "t": "Th-then"
  },
  {
   "i": 1080,
   "src": "672a5660643a",
   "t": "you want us to go up to the {{rooftop}} for\nthat?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1094,
   "src": "c922c1e823ba",
   "t": "{{hanzo}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1103,
   "src": "0ebaad548286",
   "t": "Ridiculous!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1106,
   "src": "3005400ac9f7",
   "t": "The building is about to collapse any\nsecond!?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1113,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1119,
   "src": "39e4fcbbbd0e",
   "t": "Besides, there's no way it'll wait nicely"
  },
  {
   "i": 1122,
   "src": "8c165c9ed094",
   "t": "until we reach the rooftop--"
  },
  {
   "i": 1136,
   "src": "f71322c5c57d",
   "t": "{{principal|cap}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1142,
   "src": "2cf05ff85fc6",
   "t": "It will wait."
  },
  {
   "i": 1150,
   "src": "b031a523d9b0",
   "t": "It has no intelligence."
  },
  {
   "i": 1165,
   "src": "839d0bc525b9",
   "t": "All it has is instinct, and appetite."
  },
  {
   "i": 1172,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1178,
   "src": "d6db503e8f29",
   "t": "Appetite...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1192,
   "src": "f71322c5c57d",
   "t": "{{principal|cap}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1198,
   "src": "671d3e9ff60a",
   "t": "That's right. It eats {{medal|pl}}."
  },
  {
   "i": 1201,
   "src": "730556ad947c",
   "t": "It tracks {{medal}} energy signatures and\ndevours them."
  },
  {
   "i": 1209,
   "src": "9919277c8884",
   "t": "If powerful signatures gather and\napproach,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1212,
   "src": "d355396b1fda",
   "t": "it will surely get distracted."
  },
  {
   "i": 1227,
   "src": "ecef7ada82bf",
   "t": "We can lure it for sure."
  }
 ]
}
